Control marker. Carries no code and is consumed by nothing.

It exists so a pull request can run the boot lanes against an unmodified
main: the boot job is gated on `github.event_name == 'pull_request'`
(build-arch.yml), so workflow_dispatch cannot run it, and the pull_request
trigger is path-filtered, so a diff touching none of those paths starts no
build at all. A file under tests/ satisfies the filter while changing
nothing that runs.

Not for merging.
